Short:    Protracker 3.61, music composing programm
Uploader: Tom Beyer <03821810663@btx.dtag.de>
Author:   Tom Beyer <03821810663@btx.dtag.de>
Type:     mus/edit
Version:  V3.61

Long:
	The classical of the Amiga composing programs with an very long
	history and an big fangroup. Based on the very well work of
	Cryptoburners Protracker 3.15, i collected and debugged this
	version with the follow features:

	- included Positionseditor, Presetlist, Presetlisteditor
	- Onlinehelp, Infoscreen, mod2smp, xpk mod support
	- 100 Patternmod support
	- over 50 code errors removed
	- and many more ...

	New since 3.58:

	- included 100Pattern-Mod/Song Support as in V2.3
	- mod2smp
	- new fileformat in IFF-Form (optional)
	- some very nasty bugs removed
	- and many more ...